{
  "name": "liblapack-sys",
  "description": "liblapack-sys provides low-level Rust bindings to the Linear Algebra PACKage (LAPACK) by facilitating static linking through a CMake-driven build script. The crate exposes the LAPACKE C interface, enabling Rust applications to execute high-performance numerical routines for eigenvalue decompositions and linear system solutions. It supports configurable backends via feature flags, including OpenBLAS and Netlib, to ensure interoperability with various high-performance computing environments.",
